# Regenerated by `next dev`, `next build` and `next typegen`. Tracking it means
# the import path churns between .next/types (build) and .next/dev/types (dev)
# depending on which command ran last. `pnpm typecheck` runs `next typegen`
# first, so a fresh clone still gets the typed-route definitions.
